{"2121510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tenebris Somnia", "steam_appid": 2121510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/f766f1ab1266e5055a8217d585cd2b19.poster.avif?t=1782359332\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/f766f1ab1266e5055a8217d585cd2b19.webm?t=1782359332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/f766f1ab1266e5055a8217d585cd2b19.mp4?t=1782359332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tenebris Somnia</strong> is a survival horror adventure game in the same vein as classics like <i>Silent Hill</i> or <i>Resident Evil</i> - but adapted to a retro 2D aesthetic from the 8 or 16-bit era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will struggle to survive while solving puzzles and fighting <strong>horrible</strong> creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet the secrets of the game lie within its <strong>cinematics...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach certain key points you will see sequences from a <strong>completely</strong> different point of view, made in live action with real actors and practical effects - created by a professional and award winning film crew from Argentina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/5fd5d86aebd202f0e6a984b06de439c0.poster.avif?t=1782359332\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/5fd5d86aebd202f0e6a984b06de439c0.webm?t=1782359332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/5fd5d86aebd202f0e6a984b06de439c0.mp4?t=1782359332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/f766f1ab1266e5055a8217d585cd2b19.poster.avif?t=1782359332\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/f766f1ab1266e5055a8217d585cd2b19.webm?t=1782359332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/f766f1ab1266e5055a8217d585cd2b19.mp4?t=1782359332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tenebris Somnia</strong> is a survival horror adventure game in the same vein as classics like <i>Silent Hill</i> or <i>Resident Evil</i> - but adapted to a retro 2D aesthetic from the 8 or 16-bit era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will struggle to survive while solving puzzles and fighting <strong>horrible</strong> creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet the secrets of the game lie within its <strong>cinematics...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach certain key points you will see sequences from a <strong>completely</strong> different point of view, made in live action with real actors and practical effects - created by a professional and award winning film crew from Argentina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/5fd5d86aebd202f0e6a984b06de439c0.poster.avif?t=1782359332\" width=616 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/5fd5d86aebd202f0e6a984b06de439c0.webm?t=1782359332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/extras/5fd5d86aebd202f0e6a984b06de439c0.mp4?t=1782359332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Tenebris Somnia is a 2D retro survival horror adventure game with live action cutscenes created by an award winning film crew from Argentina. Unveil the depths of a disturbing story by solving puzzles and fighting horrible creatures. ...What if they aren't just nightmares?", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/header.jpg?t=1782359332", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/03a5c65bccf278414a7111265b6b4b1b2fac564c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782359332", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121510/03a5c65bccf278414a7111265b6b4b1b2fac564c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782359332", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4GHZ Dual Core Processor or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB of VRAM or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong>